<title>USA: Wash Mutual-Great Western merger advances.</title>
<headline>Wash Mutual-Great Western merger advances.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Washington Mutual Inc said Friday its merger with Great Western Financial Corp was approved by the U.S. Office of Thrift Supervision.</p>
<p>The financial services company said it is in the process of confirming all necessary approvals from state regulatory authorities.</p>
<p>It said the merger may be completed as soon as July 1.</p>
<p>The companies have agreed to a $6.9 billion merger that will create the nation's largest savings and loan.</p>
</text>
